    "name": "FolkOrigin",
    "steam_appid": 2863790,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863790/extras/5dd0236a5348feee4d06aa6a79b58c76.poster.avif?t=1753302502\" width=600 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863790/extras/5dd0236a5348feee4d06aa6a79b58c76.webm?t=1753302502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863790/extras/5dd0236a5348feee4d06aa6a79b58c76.mp4?t=1753302502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0-------\u00a0 100% Handmade\u00a0 ---\u00a0 0% Ai\u00a0 -------</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FolkOrigin is a strategy game set on a hexagonal 2D map. The main objective is to develop a settlement in a way that maximizes the production and extraction of resources available on the map. A well-planned allocation of labor results in the efficient gathering of resources needed for trade, allowing our settlement to prosper while units can level up and boost their stats. More exotic units also arrive at the settlement and can be recruited for a fee. A well-trained and equipped unit is key to defending the settlement, conquering new areas on the map, and surviving in a world full of Slavic monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863790/extras/cb13c1928a59d53361b8313df77e6595.poster.avif?t=1753302502\" width=600 height=78 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863790/extras/cb13c1928a59d53361b8313df77e6595.webm?t=1753302502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863790/extras/cb13c1928a59d53361b8313df77e6595.mp4?t=1753302502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 29 buildings to build</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 24 resources</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 over 50 different items in your inventory </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 over 60 enemy units </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 over 40 units for recruitment </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 mode: <strong>Tutorial</strong> - the player is introduced step by step to the basic mechanics related to the development of the settlement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 mode: <strong>Free Play</strong> - the player develops his settlement in any way, without time limits, without a main goal and without an opponent who could thwart the plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 mode: <strong>Campaign - Hunting</strong> - track down and fight the 10 strongest <strong>Slavic demons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863790/extras/d3ade2d186ea6fc96e5681c023491928.poster.avif?t=1753302502\" width=600 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863790/extras/d3ade2d186ea6fc96e5681c023491928.webm?t=1753302502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863790/extras/d3ade2d186ea6fc96e5681c023491928.mp4?t=1753302502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>=====</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEMO - free version with the ability to play a tutorial with a limited development tree</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>=====</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863790/extras/b4cf449284807f5aa756caf3ba2fd0fe.poster.avif?t=1753302502\" width=600 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863790/extras/b4cf449284807f5aa756caf3ba2fd0fe.webm?t=1753302502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863790/extras/b4cf449284807f5aa756caf3ba2fd0fe.mp4?t=1753302502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m working on the game together with my younger brother, who creates all the 2D assets, such as landscapes, characters, buildings, etc. I handle everything else \u2013 coding, testing, writing all in-game content, publications, trailers, and so on. We began work on the project in September 2023.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generally, we are working on a game that we dream about and that we want to play ourselves :) <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud834\udd1e \u266a \ud834\udd1e \u266a \ud834\udd1e \u266a \ud834\udd1e \u266a \ud834\udd1e \u266a \ud834\udd1e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SFX - Victoria Wind</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ambient - AlkaKrab</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863790/extras/5dd0236a5348feee4d06aa6a79b58c76.poster.avif?t=1753302502\" width=600 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863790/extras/5dd0236a5348feee4d06aa6a79b58c76.webm?t=1753302502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863790/extras/5dd0236a5348feee4d06aa6a79b58c76.mp4?t=1753302502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0-------\u00a0 100% Handmade\u00a0 ---\u00a0 0% Ai\u00a0 -------</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FolkOrigin is a strategy game set on a hexagonal 2D map. The main objective is to develop a settlement in a way that maximizes the production and extraction of resources available on the map. A well-planned allocation of labor results in the efficient gathering of resources needed for trade, allowing our settlement to prosper while units can level up and boost their stats. More exotic units also arrive at the settlement and can be recruited for a fee. A well-trained and equipped unit is key to defending the settlement, conquering new areas on the map, and surviving in a world full of Slavic monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863790/extras/cb13c1928a59d53361b8313df77e6595.poster.avif?t=1753302502\" width=600 height=78 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863790/extras/cb13c1928a59d53361b8313df77e6595.webm?t=1753302502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863790/extras/cb13c1928a59d53361b8313df77e6595.mp4?t=1753302502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 29 buildings to build</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 24 resources</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 over 50 different items in your inventory </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 over 60 enemy units </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 over 40 units for recruitment </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 mode: <strong>Tutorial</strong> - the player is introduced step by step to the basic mechanics related to the development of the settlement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 mode: <strong>Free Play</strong> - the player develops his settlement in any way, without time limits, without a main goal and without an opponent who could thwart the plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 mode: <strong>Campaign - Hunting</strong> - track down and fight the 10 strongest <strong>Slavic demons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863790/extras/d3ade2d186ea6fc96e5681c023491928.poster.avif?t=1753302502\" width=600 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863790/extras/d3ade2d186ea6fc96e5681c023491928.webm?t=1753302502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863790/extras/d3ade2d186ea6fc96e5681c023491928.mp4?t=1753302502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>=====</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEMO - free version with the ability to play a tutorial with a limited development tree</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>=====</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863790/extras/b4cf449284807f5aa756caf3ba2fd0fe.poster.avif?t=1753302502\" width=600 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863790/extras/b4cf449284807f5aa756caf3ba2fd0fe.webm?t=1753302502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863790/extras/b4cf449284807f5aa756caf3ba2fd0fe.mp4?t=1753302502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m working on the game together with my younger brother, who creates all the 2D assets, such as landscapes, characters, buildings, etc. I handle everything else \u2013 coding, testing, writing all in-game content, publications, trailers, and so on. We began work on the project in September 2023.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generally, we are working on a game that we dream about and that we want to play ourselves :) <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud834\udd1e \u266a \ud834\udd1e \u266a \ud834\udd1e \u266a \ud834\udd1e \u266a \ud834\udd1e \u266a \ud834\udd1e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SFX - Victoria Wind</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ambient - AlkaKrab</p>",
    "short_description": "Start taking control of the map and build buildings, recruit units, fight monsters and conquer enemy villages. It's a 2D game in which you move on a hexagonal map. A strategy game combined with an RPG game. All in the times of the early Slavs. More information soon...",
